# Webion Live AR Try-On — Implementation Plan (Revised)

## Context

**This is a standalone hackathon demo.** We do NOT have access to the existing Webion codebase. The goal is to build the AR try-on working on a live Agora video call as a self-contained application, ready to impress the jury.

## Resolved Decisions

| # | Question | Decision |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Agora SDK version | **4.x** (newer SDK) |
| 2 | Python segmentation architecture | **Flask microservice** (keeps REMBG model warm in memory) |
| 3 | MediaPipe dual-instance perf | Not a priority for hackathon. Stop seller detection after capture. |
| 4 | Existing codebase integration | **Out of scope** — standalone demo |
| 5 | PNG security | **UUID-only** (no JWT on static files) |
| 6 | Go-back to previous garment | **Out of scope** — one garment at a time |
| 7 | Real-time session state sync | **Agora RTM** (simplest — comes with Agora SDK, no new dependency) |

