## Verification Plan (Hackathon-Focused)

No formal unit tests. Verification = **the demo works end-to-end on real devices**.

### Per-Track Acceptance

| Track | "It works" when... |
|---|---|
| A+C | Seller presses "Present Garment" → enforcement panel updates → mannequin detected → 3s countdown → frame captured and sent to backend |
| B | Given a PNG URL, buyer's camera activates → garment overlays on body → follows movement → screenshot works |
| D | Postman sends JPEG → Flask segments → Express returns PNG URL → PNG loads in browser → cleanup deletes files |

### End-to-End Demo Validation

Two devices, one Agora call. Seller shows garment → buyer sees it on their body. This must work 3 times in a row without error.

